{"status":true,"data":{"id":129,"name":"Skeletal Chainsaw","slug":"skeletal-chainsaw(alpha)","mod_id":"SkeletalChainsawEngine","shortDescription":"Model swaps the chainsaw to a skeletal chainsaw model and adds a customizable flashlight.","description":"Features:\r\n1. Skeletal Chainsaw model swap which has glowing eyes. The texture color emissions can be customized with any color.\r\n2. A flashlight that you can customize the color and intensity of.\r\n3. Can turn off or reduce the stamina cost for hold attacks in settings. Requires a reequip for changes to take effect.\r\n\r\nCompatibility:\r\n-Not compatible with the Pochita Chainsaw mod for obvious reasons.\r\n-Stamina Drain is not functional when using Franky's Mod Menu. But infinite stamina can be set in it.\r\n-Tested with Axel's Mod Menu. Seems to be working fine.\r\nI haven't tested all mods yet. However it would likely only have issues with mods that alter stamina or change the chainsaw in any way.\r\n\r\nCredits: Huge tanks to Franky, Shoko and Toni Macaroni. Each of them provided some code used to create this mod and all of them gave me some helpful advice needed to learn how to make this mod. Also special thanks to I'm Axel for the great modding tutorials. \r\n\r\nTo dos:\r\n\r\n1.Battery drain rate adjustment option in settings.\r\n2.Maximizing performance.\r\n3.Further bug testing.\r\n4.Checking for mod conflicts.","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":null,"isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":false,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":25,"downloads":3625,"latestVersion":"1.1.5","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":0,"commentsCount":0,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767665972473_1712802287911_skeletal-chainsaw(alpha)_thumbnail.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2026-01-15T00:41:49.642Z","createdAt":"2024-04-11T02:24:47.879Z","updatedAt"